  "prefLabel": "Pub 201.13 Communication with Board on Pending Matters",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pub 201.13 Communication with Board on Pending Matters. Except for oral communications with the board during the course of a hearing, all communication with the board on pending matters shall be by written filings in compliance with these rules.\n\nSource. #9441-A, eff 3-27-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pub100-300.html"
